    "## 5. Model: Phase-1 backbone + multi-label head\n",
    "Per-architecture feature extractor (causal LM, local/global LM, chunk-recurrent LM, or the bidirectional enc_dec encoder) → chunk pooling → gated attention + max over chunks + label-wise attention → one logit per statute. Contains the PEFT modules (LoRMA, adapters)."
   ]
