    "## 7. Training engine\n",
    "Time-budgeted (the number of steps adapts to `HP['exp_budget_min']`), fp16/bf16 autocast, gradient accumulation, OOM fallback, periodic dev evaluation and best-checkpoint restore."
   ]
  },
